      "content": "You can frame the audit results by highlighting that while the core network is robust, the current \"solid\" setup leaves blind spots that the premium monitoring package is specifically designed to eliminate. Position the \"almost nothing to report\" finding as an opportunity to sell advanced proactive defense against the specific, sophisticated threats that even a smooth audit might miss. This way, you shift the narrative from a need to fix existing issues to a strategic necessity for future risk management and total visibility.",
